@startuml Email_Workflow_Architecture_Overview
!theme aws-orange
title Invoice Processing Email Workflow - System Architecture

package "Frontend Layer" {
    [Invoice Editor UI] as UI
    [Dashboard] as Dashboard
}

package "Backend API Layer" {
    [FastAPI Main] as API
    [Email Workflow Routes] as EmailRoutes
    [Invoice Routes] as InvoiceRoutes
}

package "Service Layer" {
    [Email Service] as EmailSvc
    [Database Service] as DBSvc
    [OCR Service] as OCRSvc
}

package "External Services" {
    [SendGrid API] as SendGrid
    [SMTP Gmail] as SMTP
    [Google Document AI] as DocAI
}

package "Database Layer" {
    database "Supabase PostgreSQL" {
        [invoices] as InvoiceTable
        [email_audit_logs] as EmailLogs
        [approval_tokens] as Tokens
        [workflow_status] as Status
    }
}

package "Security Layer" {
    [JWT Token Manager] as JWT
    [Environment Config] as Config
    [SSL/TLS Encryption] as SSL
}

' Connections
UI --> API : HTTP Requests
Dashboard --> API : Status Updates

API --> EmailRoutes : Route Requests
API --> InvoiceRoutes : CRUD Operations

EmailRoutes --> EmailSvc : Email Operations
InvoiceRoutes --> DBSvc : Database Operations

EmailSvc --> SendGrid : Primary Email
EmailSvc --> SMTP : Fallback Email
EmailSvc --> JWT : Security Tokens
EmailSvc --> DBSvc : Audit Logging

DBSvc --> InvoiceTable : Invoice Data
DBSvc --> EmailLogs : Email History
DBSvc --> Tokens : Security Tokens
DBSvc --> Status : Workflow State

OCRSvc --> DocAI : Document Processing
OCRSvc --> DBSvc : Store Results

Config --> EmailSvc : Configuration
Config --> DBSvc : Database Credentials
Config --> JWT : Secret Keys

SSL --> SendGrid : Secure Connection
SSL --> SMTP : Secure Connection

note right of EmailSvc
  **Core Email Features:**
  - Professional HTML Templates
  - Multi-provider Support
  - Automatic Fallback
  - Security Token Generation
  - Audit Trail Logging
  - Retry Logic
end note

note right of JWT
  **Security Features:**
  - Time-limited Tokens (7 days)
  - Encrypted Approval URLs
  - Anti-tampering Protection
  - Secure Email Links
end note

note right of Config
  **Environment Variables:**
  - SENDGRID_API_KEY
  - SMTP_* Settings
  - JWT_SECRET
  - Database Credentials
  - Feature Flags
end note

@enduml
